This license covers the original source code authored for this repository,
namely: the `@text-to-bpmn/core` engine (DSL lexer/parser, semantic model,
BPMN emitter, orthogonal layout/renderer, and validator), the `tfm-lab` and
`company-web` applications, the `bpmn-eval` Python evaluation package, and the
accompanying scripts and documentation.

